Metrics List:
- {"name": "container_ulimits_soft", "type": "gauge", "description": "Soft ulimit values for the container root process."}
- {"name": "container_fs_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that are consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_spec_memory_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Memory limit for the container."}
- {"name": "container_fs_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that can be consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_memory_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Current memory usage in bytes, including all memory regardless of when it was accessed"}
Question: Show the filesystem usage and limit bytes for all containers of the auth service.

Metrics List:
- {"name": "machine_cpu_cores", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of logical CPU cores."}
- {"name": "machine_cpu_physical_cores", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of physical CPU cores."}
- {"name": "machine_cpu_sockets", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of CPU sockets."}
- {"name": "node_cpu_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Seconds the CPUs spent in each mode."}
- {"name": "node_cpu_guest_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Seconds the CPUs spent in guests (VMs) for each mode."}
- {"name": "container_cpu_usage_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Cumulative cpu time consumed in seconds."}
- {"name": "container_cpu_cfs_periods_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of elapsed enforcement period intervals."}
- {"name": "node_softnet_received_rps_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of times cpu woken up received_rps"}
- {"name": "node_forks_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Total number of forks."}
- {"name": "container_cpu_cfs_throttled_periods_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Number of throttled period intervals."}
Question: What is the total number of logical CPU cores for the nodes hosting the admin basic info service?
